; MITEMSHUB AI v23.0 — Volatility 10 (tiny-account parallel profile #1 of 5)
; Generated 2026-08-25. UNVALIDATED starting tune — run STRATEGY_TESTER_VALIDATION.md
; Pass-A gates before scaling size. Internal name R_10.
; CHART NAME: attach to the V10 chart exactly as named in Market Watch
; ("Volatility 10 Index" or SYN10 on this broker) — .set pins timeframes.
;
; TUNING RATIONALE (vol-tier scaling, ~10% annualized vol):
;   - Ultra-low vol: sigma is small, so spread eats a larger share of each
;     move. Demand deep extension (z>=2.3), take nearby profits (0.60 x
;     sigma_h), hard max-stop 1.0% of price, tightest caps (risk 8% equity,
;     daily halt 10% = ~1 losing trade).
;   - Expect FEW signals here — this is the portfolio's stability anchor,
;     not its volume driver. Starvation is normal, do not loosen gates.
;
